OL,17,G0232 The Climate Question
OL,18,     FThe El Nino weather pattern has
OL,19,     Fstarted and could be one of the
OL,20,     Fstrongest on record. So how does
OL,21,     FEl Nino work exactly? And what's
OL,22,     Fthe link with climate change?
