OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FSinger Lachi hid her low vision
OL,10,     Ffor years. But waking up one day
OL,11,     Fcompletely blind forced a
OL,12,     Freckoning, giving her courage to
OL,13,     Fown her identity and pursue music
OL,14,     Fwithout holding back.
OL,15,G0350 Witness History
OL,16,     FIn 1997, the remains of a Native
OL,17,     FAmerican chief were returned to
OL,18,     Fhis Lakota people after more than
OL,19,     Fa century in a London cemetery.
OL,20,     FHis great-granddaughter tells his
OL,21,     Fstory.
